  "description": "Declarative, animated architecture diagrams from YAML — rendered entirely server-side in C#. Turns Beck YAML into a single self-animating inline <svg>: layout, routing, and the full flow choreography are baked into CSS animations inside the SVG, so consumers ship no JavaScript. Includes a dependency-free authoring API (DiagramBuilder) for emitting Beck YAML from code. Pair with Beck.Skia for exact font measurement.",
